Scope note
----------
This file supplies the MIT text for the software half of the project, which the
root README already declares ("software ... remain under the MIT License for
maximum flexibility") but which had no accompanying licence text anywhere in the
repository (upstream issue #200).  It covers 9_Firmware (STM32 MCU firmware, FPGA
RTL, host tools) and any GUI/SDK source not otherwise marked.

Hardware design files (schematics, board layouts, gerbers, mechanical parts)
remain under the CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 - Permissive, whose full
text is the root `Licence` file.

The copyright holder is the original project author; if you are the maintainer
and prefer a different attribution line, edit the line above rather than the
terms.
